  "description": "Find the number of teams (i, j, k) such that ratings are increasing or decreasing.",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "1. count = 0\n2. for j from 1 to n-2:\n3.   leftLess = count elements < rating[j] in [0...j-1]\n4.   leftGreater = count elements > rating[j] in [0...j-1]\n5.   rightLess = count elements < rating[j] in [j+1...n-1]\n6.   rightGreater = count elements > rating[j] in [j+1...n-1]\n7.   count += (leftLess * rightGreater) + (leftGreater * rightLess)",
